{"sections":[],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"API Collection","role":"collectionGroup","title":"Equatable Implementations","modules":[{"name":"IvorMXL"}]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLTuplet\/Portion\/Equatable-Implementations","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"kind":"article","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLTuplet","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLTuplet\/Portion"]]},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxltuplet\/portion\/equatable-implementations"]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"topicSections":[{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLTuplet\/Portion\/!=(_:_:)"],"title":"Operators","anchor":"Operators"}],"references":{"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLTuplet/Portion":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The tuplet-portion type provides optional full control over tuplet specifications. It allows the number and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"note type (including dots) to be set for the actual and normal portions of a single tuplet. If any of these"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"elements are absent, their values are based on the time-modification element."}],"role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Portion","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxltuplet\/portion","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Portion"}],"title":"MXLTuplet.Portion","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLTuplet\/Portion","type":"topic"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL":{"type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A MusicXML parser, normalizer, validator, and formatter."}],"title":"IvorMXL","kind":"symbol","role":"collection","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/docume